>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>PreSmoke_A900</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/6633/slog_910b.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>PreSmoke_ATK_Test_A2</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/6633/slog_910b.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-27 09:41:06] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-27T09:33:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T09:41:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177405102,"discussion_id":"b4772e63e82084607088f8af1480a3bb2d6e88c6","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 matmul 算子在 BF16 类型输入包含 `inf` 值时，输出错误地变为全 `nan` 的问题。根因在于 `Nz2NdMulsAndGatherMask` 函数中使用 `Muls` 指令时，由于该指令不支持 BF16 数据类型，原先通过 `ReinterpretCast<half>()` 将 BF16 重新解释为 FP16；但 BF16 的 `inf` 位模式在 FP16 下被解释为 `nan`（未定义值），导致 `nan` 扩散。修复方案是将 `ReinterpretCast` 的目标类型从 `half`（FP16）改为 `int16_t`（有符号整数），因为整数类型不存在 `nan` 值，位模式得以原样保留，从而正确完成乘法操作。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`ReinterpretCast` 目标类型从 `half` 改为 `int16_t`**：将 `tensorND` 和 `tensorNZ` 的重新解释类型由 `half` 替换为 `int16_t`，避免 BF16 的 `inf` 位模式被 FP16 误解释为 `nan`。\n- **`Muls` 的标量参数类型从 `half` 改为 `int16_t`**：将 `static_cast<half>(1.0)` 改为 `static_cast<int16_t>(1)`，确保标量值与重新解释后的整数张量类型一致。\n- **改动集中在 `mat_mul_nz2nd_util.h` 的 `Nz2NdMulsAndGatherMask` 函数内**：仅涉及 3 行局部变量声明和类型转换，不影响函数签名与外部调用方。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T09:40:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T09:40:08+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177405352,"discussion_id":"34b7ba0ef3139bbd0f03524321afe4c3ed1b2773","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=669b4d37f09c4c088c393fdbf0f50b93&pipelineRunId=7e50213668a04b95905c7ca83f95d821&projectName=CANN'>7e50213668a04b95905c7ca83f95d821</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_3119201973994e5099d47c3deb367af6/3a83b39224fb34d68d545c4c32d63d02?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>antipoison</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/ddec71a9-1baa-468d-bd8e-607b69abcb70/CANN/ops-nn?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n               